    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Welcome to the zombie apocalypse experience of a lifetime \u2013 and now worse than ever!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The true, realistic and solitary experience of surviving a zombie apocalypse.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >&quot;Shoot zombies to relieve stress and go back to sleep. Nothing like a peaceful life in the countryside... Forgetting that they were once people helps ease the anxiety. It feels less guilty blowing the brains out of a <i>non-human</i>&quot;.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Tirelessly kill zombies to the sound of classical music, nothing else. <br><strong>This is the worst zombie neighborhood!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You have been warned...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
